OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA blustery day ahead with
OL,6,Fstrongest gusts around coasts. Cloudy
OL,7,Finitially with an odd spot of rain,
OL,8,Falthough brighter spells possible
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon. Heavy
OL,10,Fpersistent rain arriving towards dusk.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA wet
OL,13,Fand windy start to Wednesday, but this
OL,14,Fclearing to sunshine and showers.
OL,15,FTurning more settled from Thursday
OL,16,Fwith more dry and bright weather.
OL,17,FWinds also easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
